// Signing for local builds. With no identity the app is signed ad hoc and
// runs, but an ad-hoc signature changes on every build: macOS then treats the
// app as new and drops its Photos permission, so each rebuild lands on the
// first-run screen. To keep the permission, put your own development
// certificate in Signing.local.xcconfig (not checked in):
//
//   CODE_SIGN_IDENTITY = Apple Development: Your Name (TEAMID)
CODE_SIGN_IDENTITY = -
#include? "Signing.local.xcconfig"
